[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3841.829, "timestamp": "01:04:01", "text": "是的。是的。就像你一样，你什么都懂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3843.19, "timestamp": "01:04:03", "text": "其中三人。坚持，稍等。实际上，从来没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3844.95, "timestamp": "01:04:04", "text": "头脑。哦，不。你会得到其中一个。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3846.95, "timestamp": "01:04:06", "text": "需要从中选择其中一个。比如哪个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3850.15, "timestamp": "01:04:10", "text": "拼写，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3852.069, "timestamp": "01:04:12", "text": "所以，你要么选择你，要么选择你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3853.99, "timestamp": "01:04:13", "text": "选跳舞的灯光、光或神圣的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3856.39, "timestamp": "01:04:16", "text": "火焰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3858.15, "timestamp": "01:04:18", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3858.87, "timestamp": "01:04:18", "text": "然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3860.87, "timestamp": "01:04:20", "text": "这些都是咒语。它应该会给出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3862.789, "timestamp": "01:04:22", "text": "例如关于咒语的信息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3871.91, "timestamp": "01:04:31", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3879.109, "timestamp": "01:04:39", "text": "哦，等等。我等着。我是机器人。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3881.029, "timestamp": "01:04:41", "text": "等待。这里没有机器人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3882.23, "timestamp": "01:04:42", "text": "不，你不用担心。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3884.15, "timestamp": "01:04:44", "text": "这是你的课外活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3885.75, "timestamp": "01:04:45", "text": "咒语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3887.029, "timestamp": "01:04:47", "text": "如果说有什么区别的话，那就是它实际上更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3889.51, "timestamp": "01:04:49", "text": "如果你选择的东西不在你的考虑范围内"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3891.029, "timestamp": "01:04:51", "text": "因为你将无法参加课程"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3893.829, "timestamp": "01:04:53", "text": "这些咒语在呃之外"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3897.029, "timestamp": "01:04:57", "text": "德鲁伊之外。我的意思是，在……里面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3898.63, "timestamp": "01:04:58", "text": "德鲁伊。"}]